WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.000
<b>Minakami Festa</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:07.670
<b>Cafe Corner</b>

00:09.330 --> 00:11.920
<b>Here's the rice ball meal you ordered.</b>

00:11.920 --> 00:13.250
<b>Wow!</b>

00:13.960 --> 00:16.040
<b>This waiter guy's a hottie!</b>

00:16.040 --> 00:18.080
<b>He is! What's your name?</b>

00:18.790 --> 00:21.420
<b>M-m-m-m-m-my name?!</b>

00:22.830 --> 00:26.210
<b>Takashima-kun, take a break from serving
and go help in the back.</b>

00:26.500 --> 00:28.330
<b>Sorry, thanks.</b>

00:33.000 --> 00:34.960
<b>This must be Noda-kun's doing...</b>

00:36.330 --> 00:38.670
<b>Next up, Humano Rangers!</b>

00:38.670 --> 00:40.080
<b>Oh, nice!</b>

00:43.080 --> 00:47.040
<b>It's "Precious Memories" from iLive.
This must be Takashima-kun's.</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:49.460
<b>Uh, isn't the music choice kinda geeky?</b>

00:49.460 --> 00:54.460
<b>It used to turn me off, too, but I can sing to this now.</b>

00:56.580 --> 00:58.460
<b>Don't they know any other songs?</b>

00:58.630 --> 01:00.290
<b>Talk about lame, huh?</b>

01:03.830 --> 01:07.210
<b>You realize people are gonna laugh
at these geeky choices, right?</b>

01:07.540 --> 01:09.580
<b>Why go out of your way to act lame?</b>

01:10.920 --> 01:13.540
<b>Why? Because heroes are super cool!</b>

01:13.540 --> 01:18.130
<b>People who don't understand the joys of 2D work
are the ones totally missing out in life.</b>

01:19.460 --> 01:21.960
<b>"Space Prosecutor Tryal" is another good one.</b>

01:21.960 --> 01:27.210
<b>Choosing songs is tough. iLive songs
are all phenomenal, even the B-side stuff.</b>

01:25.750 --> 01:27.830
<b>This and this are great, too!</b>

01:28.580 --> 01:32.210
<b>Okay, our next number's gonna be this one!</b>

01:30.500 --> 01:33.000
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys</b>

01:48.330 --> 01:50.710
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

01:50.710 --> 01:53.540
<b>I posses a special power</b>

01:53.540 --> 01:55.710
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

01:55.710 --> 02:00.170
<b>All are powerless</b>

02:03.250 --> 02:05.960
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

02:05.960 --> 02:08.750
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

02:08.750 --> 02:10.960
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

02:10.960 --> 02:13.330
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

02:13.460 --> 02:16.130
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

02:16.130 --> 02:18.460
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

02:18.460 --> 02:22.250
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

02:22.540 --> 02:24.830
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

02:25.000 --> 02:27.380
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:27.380 --> 02:29.880
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

02:29.880 --> 02:32.460
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

02:32.460 --> 02:34.830
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

02:34.830 --> 02:37.630
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:37.630 --> 02:40.130
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:40.130 --> 02:42.540
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

02:42.540 --> 02:45.000
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

02:45.000 --> 02:47.580
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

02:47.580 --> 02:50.130
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

02:50.130 --> 02:52.750
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

02:52.920 --> 02:55.250
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:55.250 --> 02:57.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

03:03.880 --> 03:06.630
<b>Episode 9</b>

03:03.880 --> 03:06.630
<b>The Number You're Trying to Reach</b>

03:04.580 --> 03:06.130
<b>Where to next?</b>

03:04.670 --> 03:06.290
<b>Thank you!</b>

03:06.130 --> 03:07.080
<b>Hmm, I dunno...</b>

03:08.630 --> 03:09.920
<b>Time to switch shifts.</b>

03:10.960 --> 03:12.210
<b>Nanako-chan.</b>

03:13.000 --> 03:14.670
<b>It's getting kinda crowded for lunch.</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:16.130
<b>Good luck.</b>

03:16.580 --> 03:20.420
<b>I'll be looking forward to
the Drama Club's play too, Mizuki-chan.</b>

03:25.830 --> 03:27.290
<b>Hey, Hijiri-san.</b>

03:28.710 --> 03:31.630
<b>Wanna go wander around the festival together?</b>

03:31.630 --> 03:33.210
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

03:33.710 --> 03:35.380
<b>Uh, "why"...?</b>

03:36.170 --> 03:38.630
<b>To check out the competition, right Rei?</b>

03:38.630 --> 03:44.080
<b>Y-yeah. If we want to get voted #1,
we should check out what we're up against, right?</b>

03:44.080 --> 03:45.960
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

03:46.540 --> 03:47.880
<b>I'm coming, too.</b>

03:50.290 --> 03:52.670
<b>If we're doing this, we'd better do it properly.</b>

03:52.790 --> 03:55.290
<b>Come on, Rei, Mizuki.</b>

03:55.290 --> 03:56.630
<b>You're on a first name basis now?!</b>

03:57.500 --> 04:00.420
<b>Back in LA, this was normal.</b>

04:06.210 --> 04:08.290
<b>Mmm, delicious!</b>

04:09.210 --> 04:12.710
<b>At the Tea Ceremony Club,
you can enjoy Japanese sweets and maccha!</b>

04:11.290 --> 04:13.420
<b>That screen sure catches your attention.</b>

04:12.710 --> 04:14.330
<b>Please stop by!</b>

04:13.420 --> 04:16.040
<b>The Broadcast Committee Chairman's on a roll, huh?</b>

04:14.880 --> 04:22.460
<b>Next, please enjoy the Art Club's amazing work,
set to one of my favorite songs, "Kiss for Love."</b>

04:23.080 --> 04:25.540
<b>Hey, this song is Kirito Setsuna's-</b>

04:25.540 --> 04:26.420
<b>Huh?</b>

04:26.420 --> 04:27.710
<b>Let's go that way!</b>

04:27.960 --> 04:30.210
<b>H-hey! Don't leave me behind, Futaba!</b>

04:31.960 --> 04:33.710
<b>Somebody, help</b>

04:33.710 --> 04:36.710
<b>Cursed Hospital Ward</b>

04:34.580 --> 04:36.710
<b>"C-Cursed Hospital Ward"?!</b>

04:37.040 --> 04:40.710
<b>I heard they had a horror expert
and it's supposed to be pretty legit.</b>

04:41.040 --> 04:44.080
<b>But it's all phony and fake, you know?</b>

04:44.380 --> 04:47.960
<b>If you're scared, Mizuki and I will go just the two of us.</b>

04:48.540 --> 04:50.250
<b>Who're you calling "scared"?!</b>

04:50.670 --> 04:52.630
<b>Let's go. Let's go right now.</b>

04:58.710 --> 04:59.710
<b>Tsukumo-kun?!</b>

04:58.830 --> 04:59.710
<b>Rei?!</b>

05:07.210 --> 05:09.210
<b>Exit</b>

05:16.000 --> 05:19.420
<b>Well, for something made by students,
they did a pretty good job.</b>

05:20.250 --> 05:23.540
<b>Then let me invite you down
to the cursed depths once more.</b>

05:24.290 --> 05:27.080
<b>Though I can't guarantee you'll come back alive.</b>

05:27.580 --> 05:30.750
<b>Nakamura-kun, are you sure
you're supposed to come out here?</b>

05:31.250 --> 05:36.000
<b>Right. I suppose I'll cast myself into the darkness again.</b>

05:38.920 --> 05:44.000
<b>Th-that's the guy who's going to play Cinderella
in the play later? Talk about awful casting!</b>

05:44.000 --> 05:45.540
<b>You're way too scared.</b>

05:47.080 --> 05:48.500
<b>This looks interesting!</b>

05:48.500 --> 05:49.920
<b>Wanna go see it?</b>

05:50.380 --> 05:52.710
<b>Which way is the gym again?</b>

05:53.250 --> 05:55.790
<b>Princess Rhapsodies</b>

05:53.250 --> 05:55.790
<b>A Fairy Tale Turned Upside Down</b>

05:53.630 --> 05:55.250
<b>That flyer...</b>

05:57.790 --> 06:01.250
<b>The Drama Club presents a cross-dressing
"Fairy Tale Turned Upside Down"!</b>

06:01.540 --> 06:03.500
<b>So many spectacular things to see!</b>

06:04.040 --> 06:05.790
<b>Please come and watch.</b>

06:05.920 --> 06:07.080
<b>I thought so!</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:08.750
<b>Hey!</b>

06:09.420 --> 06:10.540
<b>Let us help!</b>

06:12.710 --> 06:15.460
<b>You guys go and enjoy the festival.</b>

06:16.920 --> 06:21.540
<b>Nonsense. This is part of our job.</b>

06:23.670 --> 06:25.710
<b>"Impossible to recreate on film!"</b>

06:25.710 --> 06:29.210
<b>The acting for the prince's horse is so amazing,
you don't want to miss it!</b>

06:30.580 --> 06:32.250
<b>Please come see us!</b>

06:32.540 --> 06:33.880
<b>This looks like fun!</b>

06:33.880 --> 06:34.960
<b>Wanna go?</b>

06:36.630 --> 06:38.460
<b>This is looking good!</b>

06:38.630 --> 06:41.830
<b>Cinderella... played by Toga Ryushoin?!</b>

06:42.790 --> 06:46.960
<b>Urg, it's Sekiya-senpai. That doesn't look good...</b>

06:49.580 --> 06:51.130
<b>Makeup's done!</b>

06:51.460 --> 06:53.750
<b>First, we have our Thumbelina, Noda-kun!</b>

06:53.750 --> 06:54.710
<b>Hiyah!</b>

06:56.710 --> 06:58.170
<b>He's pretty cute!</b>

06:58.670 --> 07:01.170
<b>Our Snow White, Takashima-kun!</b>

07:01.790 --> 07:02.790
<b>Tee hee!</b>

07:02.790 --> 07:03.960
<b>Woo woo!</b>

07:04.750 --> 07:07.500
<b>A pretty boy has what it takes
to look pretty as a girl too, huh?</b>

07:07.710 --> 07:09.880
<b>And for Cinderella, Nakamura-kun!</b>

07:13.540 --> 07:16.420
<b>Wow, so beautiful!</b>

07:17.540 --> 07:19.630
<b>I'm so glad we worked hard on the costumes!</b>

07:19.630 --> 07:24.830
<b>The audience is gonna be all over this!
They'll vote for the Drama Club for sure!</b>

07:25.710 --> 07:28.790
<b>An existence in a higher dimension
transcending gender...</b>

07:28.790 --> 07:30.790
<b>That's me, Toga Ryushoin.</b>

07:30.790 --> 07:32.880
<b>At present, I have become Cinderella...</b>

07:32.880 --> 07:37.290
<b>No, a glass valkyrie who is a solitary warrior!</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:37.580
<b>President! We've got trouble!</b>

07:37.580 --> 07:41.710
<b>They've started up a guerilla gig outside!
All the customers are going that way!</b>

07:41.710 --> 07:42.540
<b>What?!</b>

07:43.000 --> 07:45.130
<b>But unscheduled gigs aren't allowed!</b>

07:45.790 --> 07:46.830
<b>Wait!</b>

07:47.170 --> 07:49.040
<b>You have to prioritize the play!</b>

07:49.420 --> 07:51.420
<b>We'll go check outside.</b>

07:55.750 --> 07:57.040
<b>Sekiya-senpai?!</b>

07:57.040 --> 07:59.750
<b>I was right about him!</b>

08:00.420 --> 08:02.920
<b>This should mess with that guy's play!</b>

08:02.920 --> 08:04.790
<b>Listen to me sing!</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:07.040
<b>What's up with this?!</b>

08:07.540 --> 08:11.080
<b>Hey everyone! Are you enjoying the festival?!</b>

08:11.080 --> 08:12.580
<b>Yeah!</b>

08:13.420 --> 08:15.830
<b>You having fun?! C'mon, louder!</b>

08:15.960 --> 08:20.420
<b>The bastard. He's doing this because
our show's just about to start.</b>

08:17.040 --> 08:18.250
<b>I can't hear you! Right side!</b>

08:19.330 --> 08:20.420
<b>Left side! Right side!</b>

08:20.420 --> 08:24.630
<b>He's not singing and his crowd interaction's corny.
What a despicable performance!</b>

08:21.630 --> 08:24.830
<b>Left side! Right side!</b>

08:24.920 --> 08:28.330
<b>The Drama Club's play is about to start in the gym!</b>

08:28.500 --> 08:32.330
<b>They'll be a handsome horse, too!
You'll totally miss out if you don't see it!</b>

08:33.130 --> 08:34.670
<b>Isn't there anything we can do?</b>

08:40.040 --> 08:41.500
<b>Mikuriya-kun?</b>

08:47.750 --> 08:49.500
<b>There you are! Mikuriya-kun!</b>

08:52.540 --> 08:54.330
<b>I didn't realize you followed me.</b>

08:56.000 --> 08:57.710
<b>I'm sorry if I'm wrong...</b>

08:59.040 --> 09:01.750
<b>but are you thinking of challenging
Sekiya-senpai with that?</b>

09:06.210 --> 09:07.250
<b>Wait!</b>

09:08.710 --> 09:10.540
<b>I knew this already, but he's so fast!</b>

09:11.250 --> 09:13.460
<b>Huh? But the stage isn't that way...</b>

09:14.880 --> 09:16.670
<b>Oh! I'm sorry!</b>

09:18.540 --> 09:20.210
<b>No running in the hallways.</b>

09:21.250 --> 09:22.580
<b>The Student Council president...</b>

09:23.130 --> 09:24.790
<b>We saw the flyer.</b>

09:25.130 --> 09:29.460
<b>The Drama Club must be pretty desperate
if they're asking the Hero Club for help.</b>

09:30.170 --> 09:34.580
<b>We've been working hard
to help the Drama Club prepare.</b>

09:35.170 --> 09:37.130
<b>Well, helping others is a good thing...</b>

09:37.420 --> 09:42.580
<b>But don't forget.
The next time the Hero Club causes trouble...</b>

09:43.880 --> 09:46.710
<b>Please keep your actions under control.</b>

09:52.750 --> 09:54.330
<b>Oh, right! Mikuriya-kun!</b>

09:54.920 --> 09:56.750
<b>Where could he have gone?!</b>

10:00.830 --> 10:02.170
<b>Hello? Mikuriya-kun?!</b>

10:02.170 --> 10:07.630
<b>The number you're trying to reach is currently
unavailable, or you have to be a cute girl-</b>

10:10.630 --> 10:12.130
<b>Broadcast Studio</b>

10:19.420 --> 10:22.040
<b>Three... two... one...</b>

10:22.540 --> 10:23.420
<b>Cue!</b>

10:27.000 --> 10:33.000
<b>Baby! Hey all you cute kitties at Minakami High!
Any of you bored?</b>

10:33.000 --> 10:39.000
<b>Thanks for waiting. My name's Kirito Setsuna,
here as a surprise guest!</b>

10:35.130 --> 10:40.750
<b>I'll catch the drops that overflow for you</b>

10:40.750 --> 10:44.580
<b>Now go ahead and drown in your tears</b>

10:41.960 --> 10:43.830
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys...!</b>

10:45.710 --> 10:47.750
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

10:48.630 --> 10:52.580
<b>I'm Kirito Setsuna, here as a surprise guest!</b>

10:52.920 --> 10:56.920
<b>This is "Me Hijacking a Festival"
to steal all your hearts away!</b>

10:58.170 --> 11:00.540
<b>You're kidding me! It's Kirito!</b>

11:03.500 --> 11:05.040
<b>Kirito Setsuna?</b>

11:05.040 --> 11:07.710
<b>Nothing's impossible when you have real charisma!</b>

11:11.040 --> 11:13.670
<b>Nothing's impossible when you have real charisma.</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:15.960
<b>Hey!</b>

11:19.000 --> 11:19.920
<b>Adios!</b>

11:20.580 --> 11:22.170
<b>They're exactly the same!</b>

11:22.380 --> 11:24.250
<b>Broadcast Studio</b>

11:22.830 --> 11:24.250
<b>You guys pumped up?!</b>

11:24.460 --> 11:26.000
<b>Yeah!</b>

11:26.000 --> 11:27.750
<b>Are you enjoying this?!</b>

11:27.750 --> 11:28.920
<b>Yeah!</b>

11:29.250 --> 11:34.000
<b>This is incredible!
Kirito Setsuna's live on air at our school!</b>

11:36.330 --> 11:39.130
<b>I just have one piece of advice for you all.</b>

11:39.130 --> 11:43.750
<b>Run over to the gymnasium right away.
That's our sanctuary!</b>

11:44.130 --> 11:49.130
<b>An amazing, surprising stimulation
will make revolution in your brains.</b>

11:49.130 --> 11:50.710
<b>See you on stage!</b>

11:51.040 --> 11:52.040
<b>Adios!</b>

11:52.040 --> 11:53.290
<b>Student Broadcast Committee</b>

11:52.040 --> 11:53.290
<b>Minakami High School Cultural Festival</b>

11:52.040 --> 11:53.290
<b>Minakami Festa</b>

11:53.500 --> 11:55.540
<b>He advertised the Drama Club!</b>

11:56.170 --> 11:59.630
<b>Right now, of all times? Not bad, Futaba.</b>

12:02.250 --> 12:03.920
<b>What's Kirito gonna do?!</b>

12:04.500 --> 12:07.170
<b>I dunno, he just said to come here!</b>

12:11.750 --> 12:16.330
<b>Hey baby! Here's a kiss from the heart, a present for you!</b>

12:20.960 --> 12:22.710
<b>It's suddenly gotten rowdy....</b>

12:24.460 --> 12:26.540
<b>There are like, a thousand times more people out there!</b>

12:26.540 --> 12:28.460
<b>Who's that guy?</b>

12:28.790 --> 12:32.580
<b>Kirito Setsuna. He's all the rage
on nicorico video right now.</b>

12:32.580 --> 12:34.790
<b>He advertised the Drama Club for us.</b>

12:35.580 --> 12:39.250
<b>I can sense it. His tremendous entertainment value!</b>

12:39.250 --> 12:43.380
<b>Let's work with him to make this a special,
one-of-a-kind show!</b>

12:43.380 --> 12:44.170
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:45.210 --> 12:48.710
<b>Go ahead. Make sure you get
some awesomely brilliant shots.</b>

12:49.040 --> 12:51.380
<b>Now then, time to get this show rolling!</b>

12:53.040 --> 12:58.040
<b>Once upon a time, a legendary group of
specialists called the "seven dwarfs"</b>

12:58.040 --> 13:01.040
<b>trained a princess in a bunch of unusual skills.</b>

13:01.290 --> 13:03.500
<b>Come on, Snow White!</b>

13:03.500 --> 13:06.040
<b>The actor is Tomoki Takashima!</b>

13:06.500 --> 13:08.130
<b>My name is Snow White.</b>

13:08.130 --> 13:13.210
<b>My dearest prince has been MIA for half a year.
Whatever could have happened to him?</b>

13:14.080 --> 13:15.540
<b>Isn't he super pretty?!</b>

13:15.540 --> 13:16.250
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:16.250 --> 13:19.000
<b>Upon discovering that a witch has kidnapped her prince,</b>

13:19.000 --> 13:23.580
<b>Snow White set off on an adventure to save him,
just like in an RPG.</b>

13:23.920 --> 13:29.330
<b>There, she encountered a princess codenamed
"Little Ash Girl," a.k.a. the "Underground Sweeper."</b>

13:29.330 --> 13:31.210
<b>Come on, Cinderella!</b>

13:31.540 --> 13:34.210
<b>The actor is Toga Ryushoin!</b>

13:36.170 --> 13:38.330
<b>Shoot... I'm in love...!</b>

13:39.130 --> 13:43.920
<b>My name is Cinderella. I'm off to save the prince
who gave me a glass slipper.</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:49.130
<b>I heard the witch's castle is deep in the forest,
but Golgle maps isn't working at all.</b>

13:49.420 --> 13:53.670
<b>Then we shall simply sense the witch's presence
in the atmos that fills these woods.</b>

13:54.540 --> 13:55.920
<b>The witch is that way.</b>

13:55.920 --> 14:02.130
<b>Heading for the witch's castle, Snow White and
Cinderella walked through the gloomy woods.</b>

14:02.130 --> 14:03.290
<b>Are you okay?</b>

14:03.290 --> 14:05.290
<b>Okay!</b>

14:05.500 --> 14:12.580
<b>We've put our souls into this absolutely fabulous
and fantastic show just for you, so enjoy.</b>

14:12.580 --> 14:14.040
<b>It's show time!</b>

14:14.710 --> 14:18.580
<b>For pretty supergirl Snow White
with her extraordinary set of skills,</b>

14:18.830 --> 14:22.420
<b>picking the lock on this gate is
like taking candy from a baby!</b>

14:23.000 --> 14:29.080
<b>Oh? I heard that breaking the charm on this gate
will unleash a troop of thirty soldiers...</b>

14:29.500 --> 14:30.830
<b>...and here they are.</b>

14:32.130 --> 14:33.420
<b>Dark Cross...</b>

14:34.580 --> 14:36.880
<b>...Tornado!</b>

14:36.880 --> 14:37.750
<b>Hup!</b>

14:38.830 --> 14:39.960
<b>Yah!</b>

14:41.960 --> 14:44.460
<b>I see, you're quite the fighter.</b>

14:44.460 --> 14:45.880
<b>Thanks, ally.</b>

14:58.750 --> 15:01.880
<b>This one's... already dead.</b>

15:01.880 --> 15:06.880
<b>Get in my way, and this single thumb...
will knock you down!</b>

15:06.880 --> 15:08.420
<b>Impressive, Thumbelina.</b>

15:08.420 --> 15:09.880
<b>That was two thumbs, though.</b>

15:09.880 --> 15:13.670
<b>All right, then I'll attack with
my pop idol dance steps! Sparkles!</b>

15:17.630 --> 15:23.830
<b>Bwa-ha-ha-ha! Not one of you knew
you were being toyed with. What idiots!</b>

15:24.580 --> 15:26.080
<b>Silence, imbecile!</b>

15:26.710 --> 15:30.580
<b>Why, you! Feel the curse of the witch!</b>

15:31.250 --> 15:32.710
<b>What the-</b>

15:32.710 --> 15:34.920
<b>What's going on? Is it a blackout?</b>

15:33.460 --> 15:35.130
<b>We can't see anything!</b>

15:36.130 --> 15:37.790
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

15:38.790 --> 15:40.040
<b>Is it the circuit breaker?!</b>

15:45.380 --> 15:47.040
<b>What do you think you're doing?!</b>

15:47.880 --> 15:49.040
<b>Don't worry.</b>

15:49.170 --> 15:52.420
<b>I want to put my faith in
the Hero Club's performance ability</b>

15:52.420 --> 15:55.210
<b>and see what they do beyond the scripted program.</b>

15:55.790 --> 15:59.210
<b>What is this darkness that clings to our bodies?</b>

15:59.210 --> 16:01.130
<b>Is this the witch's curse?</b>

16:01.420 --> 16:03.210
<b>Wild Guess Punch!</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:05.710
<b>Ow-ow! Yamato, that hurts!</b>

16:06.540 --> 16:12.920
<b>The princesses are in peril! What will they do?
They can't just wait for a prince, that's nonsense!</b>

16:13.420 --> 16:17.540
<b>You all have the power to help out
those in trouble, you know!</b>

16:18.000 --> 16:18.960
<b>Oh, right!</b>

16:18.960 --> 16:20.250
<b>The holy light!</b>

16:20.830 --> 16:23.580
<b>What do you all have gripped in your hooves?</b>

16:26.920 --> 16:30.460
<b>That light is the thing that will defeat evil, the "holy light"!</b>

16:30.460 --> 16:33.330
<b>Please! Lend us the power of your lights!</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:37.330
<b>Awesome, my precious kitties!
The holy power is at a maximum!</b>

16:37.880 --> 16:38.750
<b>Right.</b>

16:39.500 --> 16:40.500
<b>Take this!</b>

16:41.170 --> 16:43.830
<b>Holy Light!</b>

16:46.080 --> 16:48.830
<b>No...!</b>

16:54.920 --> 16:56.790
<b>I'm going back to my forest.</b>

16:56.790 --> 16:59.040
<b>It's all about reverse harems these days!</b>

16:59.040 --> 17:00.960
<b>My seven dwarves are waiting for me!</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:03.290
<b>More training for me!</b>

17:03.290 --> 17:05.750
<b>It's back to sweeping evil for me.</b>

17:06.080 --> 17:09.880
<b>I belong in a world where solitude
and extermination smolder gray like ash.</b>

17:13.710 --> 17:17.960
<b>If any of you kitties felt your heart tingle,
cast a vote for the Drama Club!</b>

17:18.420 --> 17:20.170
<b>Thanks, bye!</b>

17:22.330 --> 17:26.710
<b>Now it's time to announce the results
for this year's popularity poll!</b>

17:26.710 --> 17:27.830
<b>Student Council President?</b>

17:28.170 --> 17:34.000
<b>Here we go. In third place, Class 2-F, "Let's Dance"!</b>

17:36.420 --> 17:40.130
<b>In second place, Class 1-A "Cursed Hospital Ward"!</b>

17:43.630 --> 17:48.380
<b>And in first place in the popularity poll
for this year's cultural festival:</b>

17:49.630 --> 17:53.080
<b>"Princess Rhapsodies:
A Fairy Tale Turned Upside Down"</b>

17:53.880 --> 17:56.000
<b>...by the members of the Drama Club.</b>

17:56.330 --> 17:58.790
<b>All right!</b>

18:00.000 --> 18:01.080
<b>First place?!</b>

18:01.880 --> 18:08.460
<b>Thank you, thank you! Thanks to all of you,
they won't get rid of the Drama Club!</b>

18:11.460 --> 18:14.000
<b>Really. Thank you so much!</b>

18:14.500 --> 18:17.960
<b>That's so great! Really great!!</b>

18:18.880 --> 18:20.750
<b>You've got a deluge of tears there, Ryushoin.</b>

18:21.630 --> 18:24.420
<b>This is simply my overflowing magic energy</b>

18:24.420 --> 18:28.960
<b>streaming down in crystalline form:
a phenomenon known as "crystal tears."</b>

18:30.750 --> 18:33.000
<b>Why should I have to do this?!</b>

18:33.630 --> 18:35.670
<b>It's punishment for breaking the rules.</b>

18:38.710 --> 18:39.790
<b>Mikuriya-kun!</b>

18:45.790 --> 18:50.250
<b>Thanks. If it weren't for you, Mikuriya-kun,
things would have gone horribly.</b>

18:50.250 --> 18:51.710
<b>What... are you talking about?</b>

18:51.880 --> 18:53.170
<b>Why do you hide it?</b>

18:53.790 --> 18:58.170
<b>Most people don't appreciate
my avant-garde, rock 'n roll tastes.</b>

18:58.580 --> 19:01.580
<b>That's why I unleash my true self online.</b>

19:02.330 --> 19:03.670
<b>That's your true self?</b>

19:04.250 --> 19:08.790
<b>To tell you the truth, anime, manga, games,
light novels, superheroes, Vocaloid, pop idols...</b>

19:08.790 --> 19:10.080
<b>I love them all!</b>

19:10.080 --> 19:12.710
<b>After all this, you're coming out
that you're an all-genre otaku?</b>

19:13.080 --> 19:15.210
<b>As long as I have the internet
I can shut myself inside for days!</b>

19:15.460 --> 19:19.630
<b>My number one dream is to become a musician,
but if I can't I want to be a NEET!</b>

19:19.630 --> 19:23.330
<b>Slow down a bit! I can't keep up
with this outpour of confessions!</b>

19:23.460 --> 19:28.250
<b>I've lived my life in secret, worried about
the cold stares I might get, but Red...</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:34.920
<b>No, Noda and them made me realize...
that sneaking around isn't rocktastic at all.</b>

19:35.630 --> 19:37.380
<b>Then from now on...</b>

19:38.250 --> 19:43.170
<b>I won't hide who I am.
But Kirito's true identity is an exception.</b>

19:44.130 --> 19:46.630
<b>Stars ought to be mysterious, right?</b>

19:48.210 --> 19:50.380
<b>You're calling yourself a "star"...?</b>

19:55.920 --> 19:58.330
<b>We really worked hard this time, huh?</b>

19:59.790 --> 20:01.290
<b>Use this to wipe your tears.</b>

20:01.790 --> 20:02.790
<b>Thanks...</b>

20:02.790 --> 20:03.960
<b>Hey, this is a rag!</b>

20:04.290 --> 20:06.250
<b>It's new. Don't worry!</b>

20:07.290 --> 20:10.080
<b>The "All-star Mayim Mayim" is a must-see video, huh?</b>

20:10.630 --> 20:14.380
<b>Wait, are you an iLiver?! Can you talk the talk?
Who's your favorite?</b>

20:14.380 --> 20:20.210
<b>If I had to choose, I like Kokochi, but I have respect
for iLive itself more than just the character.</b>

20:20.960 --> 20:23.880
<b>That level of content is hard to come by.</b>

20:24.380 --> 20:26.380
<b>You know what you're talking about, Mikuriya!</b>

20:27.040 --> 20:28.380
<b>U-um...</b>

20:29.460 --> 20:32.630
<b>Mikuriya-kun, the folk dance is starting soon!</b>

20:33.500 --> 20:37.080
<b>Hey, kitties! What, you want to dance with me and fire?</b>

20:37.500 --> 20:39.830
<b>Uh, you're not usually like this...</b>

20:40.420 --> 20:43.000
<b>Sure thing, my demure little kitties.</b>

20:43.500 --> 20:46.000
<b>Wh-where's your usual cool attitude...?</b>

20:46.380 --> 20:51.000
<b>We'll spend some special and
precious time together. Let's dance!</b>

20:51.580 --> 20:53.040
<b>Forget it...</b>

20:56.290 --> 20:59.670
<b>It's a victory dance! Come on, Snow White and co.!</b>

20:59.920 --> 21:03.210
<b>What's that, Sora-chan?!
You want to sneak out just the two of us?</b>

21:03.210 --> 21:04.830
<b>If you say so...!</b>

21:05.750 --> 21:08.830
<b>Takashima-kun really doesn't care for real girls, huh?</b>

21:10.380 --> 21:12.330
<b>Your eyes are still red. You okay?</b>

21:12.330 --> 21:18.170
<b>Not a problem. It's just the flames of victory
playfully dancing in my eyes.</b>

21:18.830 --> 21:20.080
<b>Okay, then.</b>

21:23.330 --> 21:25.920
<b>Hijiri-san, it's time for you to dance with me.</b>

21:27.710 --> 21:31.580
<b>Mizuki-chan! We're gonna take a group photo!</b>

21:31.580 --> 21:32.920
<b>C'mon, hurry!</b>

21:34.330 --> 21:36.040
<b>Well, gotta go.</b>

21:38.080 --> 21:40.250
<b>What am I supposed to do with this hoof now...?</b>

21:43.670 --> 21:46.130
<b>Holy Light!</b>

21:46.130 --> 21:49.460
<b>That's shiny! Do that somewhere else, stupid boy!</b>

22:03.920 --> 22:08.580
<b>A vivid melody shrouded in a seasonal wind</b>

22:08.580 --> 22:11.670
<b>Calls to me</b>

22:11.920 --> 22:19.130
<b>Rhythm overflows, accelerating the sound of footsteps</b>

22:19.540 --> 22:27.380
<b>Let's go look for something we'll never
get with our heads hanging down</b>

22:27.540 --> 22:37.630
<b>If I go with you, I'm sure we can leap over the highest of walls</b>

22:38.040 --> 22:40.330
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.670 --> 22:44.580
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.580 --> 22:47.790
<b>On those wings you illustrated</b>

22:47.790 --> 22:51.580
<b>Keep flying, and to a story</b>

22:51.830 --> 22:56.460
<b>We'll soar through tomorrow</b>

22:56.460 --> 23:00.580
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.580 --> 23:03.920
<b>That heartbeat that won't disappear</b>

23:03.920 --> 23:07.830
<b>Keep trying, and to a story</b>

23:07.830 --> 23:11.500
<b>Harmonies overlap</b>

23:11.670 --> 23:17.290
<b>The image of the future that doesn't belong to anyone</b>

23:17.670 --> 23:22.670
<b>I'll draw it, with you</b>

23:26.380 --> 23:29.250
<b>The time has come! The time has come!</b>

23:27.420 --> 23:29.040
<b>They're disbanding the Hero Club?!</b>

23:27.880 --> 23:29.540
<b>The time has come!! !! !!</b>

23:29.040 --> 23:31.250
<b>Because of Sports Day?! Or the cultural festival?!</b>

23:29.330 --> 23:34.000
<b>I demand a sacrifice! I demand a sacrifice!</b>

23:30.040 --> 23:33.460
<b>Please don't get rid of the Hero Club!</b>

23:30.330 --> 23:32.040
<b>I demand a sacrifice!! !! !! !!</b>

23:31.460 --> 23:34.000
<b>There are so many possible reasons, I can't argue at all!</b>

23:31.630 --> 23:32.630
<b>I demand a sacrifice!! !! !! !!</b>

23:32.330 --> 23:34.170
<b>Ia! Ia! Umr At-tawil!!!!!!</b>

23:32.420 --> 23:34.380
<b>Dohsa Clozn!! Dohsa Clozn!!</b>

23:32.500 --> 23:34.540
<b>Burning Dark Flame of December</b>

23:32.540 --> 23:34.460
<b>My left hand is throbbing!! !! !! !! !! !!</b>

23:32.750 --> 23:34.250
<b>Final Tactics Hyde</b>

23:32.750 --> 23:33.790
<b>Imperial Cross</b>

23:32.920 --> 23:33.880
<b>Gildivalan!! !! !!</b>

23:33.130 --> 23:34.460
<b>Ia! Ia! Cthulhu!!!!!!</b>

23:33.460 --> 23:34.540
<b>Fond De Veau</b>

23:34.000 --> 23:35.290
<b>Quiet, imbecile!</b>

23:35.080 --> 23:36.130
<b>Quiet imbecile!!</b>

23:35.880 --> 23:37.330
<b>We've got to do something!</b>

23:36.830 --> 23:40.460
<b>If we endure this, we can defeat the Student Council!</b>

23:37.670 --> 23:40.380
<b>Next episode: "Mingled in the Darkness
of Solitude and Twisted Logic."</b>
